TulsiOS: dwm colours from X resources (dwm.normbgcolor, dwm.normbordercolor,
dwm.normfgcolor, dwm.selbgcolor, dwm.selbordercolor, dwm.selfgcolor), read at
start and again whenever the resource database changes (xrdb -merge rewrites
the root window's RESOURCE_MANAGER, which dwm already watches), so a theme
switch (tulsi-theme, ADR 0021) recolours the bars, borders and tray at once.
Applies after dwm-systray-6.8.diff; config.h holds the colour buffers and the
resources table.

